Description:It is your first main phase. You control Craw Wurm (6/4) and Grizzly Bears, both summoning sick. Wild Ride (target creature gets +3/+0 and haste; harmonize {4}{R}) is in your graveyard, and you have two red mana floating. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-harmonize-tap-power | Harmonize casts the card from the graveyard, and you may tap an untapped creature you control to reduce the cost by its power (CR 702.180a); tapping is not a {T} cost, so a summoning-sick creature may do it: tap the Wurm to pay, give the Bears +3/+0 and haste, 5 damage; tapping the Bears leaves the cost too high
